Package: outline-fedora
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ndxf <16838331+ndxf@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: iproute2, jq, systemd, coreutils
Homepage: https://github.com/ndxf/outline-fedora
Description: Native CLI Outline VPN client
 outline-fedora is a native Go replacement for the upstream Outline
 Electron client on Linux. Provides an `ouf` CLI, `oufdee` daemon, and
 `ouf-panic` emergency revert script. Every host-mutating action
 (TUN, routes, DNS) is recorded to a snapshot before it happens; if
 anything goes wrong, the panic script reverts the machine to its
 pre-connect state without needing the daemon or Go runtime.
 .
 Uses the Jigsaw outline-sdk (Apache-2.0) as its Shadowsocks transport.
